{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117398","id":3396275785,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7Kbw5J","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117398.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117398/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117398/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117398/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3c7b73aa87ac425e8fee6ad5cf6f8f4618ab3055","number":117398,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Disable tooltip and symbol lookup for class names in non-docstring comments","user":{"login":"Dowsley","id":22419861,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE5ODYx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22419861?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley","html_url":"https://github.com/Dowsley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Dowsley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117306\r\n\r\n`lookup_code()` resolves class names before parsing, so it has no awareness of whether the symbol is inside a comment. this causes hover tooltips and Ctrl/Cmd+Click navigation to trigger on class names in comments (e.g. `# Color is too saturated`).\r\n\r\nThis change adds `_should_skip_symbol()` to `ScriptTextEditor`, which is called before `lookup_code()` in three places:\r\n- `_show_symbol_tooltip` - hover tooltips\r\n- `_validate_symbol` - underline on Ctrl/Cmd+hover\r\n- `_lookup_symbol` - navigation on Ctrl/Cmd+Click\r\n\r\nThese are independent signal handlers for `symbol_hovered`, `symbol_validate`, and `symbol_lookup` respectively, so each needs their own check\r\n\r\nThe check skips symbols inside comments, with an exception for bracket references in doc comments (e.g. `## [Color]`)\r\n\r\n## Test plan\r\n- `# Color is too saturated` - no tooltip on hover, no navigation on Ctrl/Cmd+Click\r\n- `## Color is a class` - no tooltip, no navigation\r\n- `## [Color] is a class` - tooltip works, navigation works\r\n- `var c: Color` - tooltip works, navigation works\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42b45365-0cc0-4e69-b829-398265dfe851","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/g